.TH strlist_joins 3
.SH NAME
strlist_joins \- join string list elements with string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "strlist.h"
.PP
.BI "void strlist_joins(const strlist *" sl ", stralloc *" sa ", const char *" sep ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B strlist_joins
concatenates the elements of
.I sl
into
.I sa
using the string
.I sep
as the separator.